msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/aggregationFunctionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "aggregationFunction is functional"
msgstr "aggregationFunction 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/aggregationFunctionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:aggregationFunction is functional: a spatial aggregation applies exactly one statistical function — count, sum, average, density, minimum, maximum, or centroid — so computing a different function over the same region is a different aggregation."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:aggregationFunction 是函数性的:一次空间聚合恰好应用一种统计函数——计数、求和、平均值、密度、最小值、最大值或质心——因此在同一区域上计算不同的函数即构成不同的聚合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/minimumPopulationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "minimumPopulation is functional"
msgstr "minimumPopulation 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/minimumPopulationFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:minimumPopulation is functional: a spatial aggregation carries exactly one k-anonymity threshold, the single minimum population size below which its result is suppressed at projection time."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:minimumPopulation 是函数式的:一个空间聚合恰好携带一个 k-匿名阈值,即在投影时若结果所涉人口规模低于该单一最小值便会被抑制的那个数值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/aggregationFunctionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:aggregationFunction names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:aggregationFunction 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/aggregationFunctionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/aggregationFunctionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:aggregationFunction, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:aggregationFunction, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/aggregationFunctionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:aggregationFunctionFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:aggregationFunction ."
msgstr "gmeow:aggregationFunctionFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:aggregationFunction ."

